    "solution": "Lean into the boost, then jump before the fork so the empty train continues low and masks the upward beam. Take the feather and jump again. Cut downward as you pass the mirror above the high stop; the blade can be started several frames before reaching it. Land beyond the light shaft. When its shutter opens, the prepared mirror sends light across the high track and down the enclosed duct to the receiver, opening the sealed exit. Taking the train high blocks that circuit wherever it parks in the high pocket.",
    "nearestExisting": "F18 uses one cart for speed and a later shadow; B15 separates a knight and a useful object. Here the branch itself asks you to leave the vehicle: its low destination supplies shade while the knight takes the feather route above.",
